 ('Procedures and training', 'Write for a new person.', ['Short numbered steps with screenshots.', 'Checklists.', 'Practice with sample data.', 'Sign-off on competence.'], 'New staff reach target accuracy after 2 days using the checklist.', 'Write the procedure and train a peer.', 'Ask a peer to complete the tasks alone.'),
 ('Quality control', 'Check before the client does.', ['Sample checks: 10% of items.', 'Error types and causes.', 'Fix causes, not just errors.', 'Second-person check on risky steps.'], '100 items, 3 errors found = 97%: below 98%, so add a check on amounts.', 'Check a sample of 50.', 'Calculate the accuracy.'),
