 quiz=[('Name two outsourceable processes.', 'Data entry and invoice processing.'), ('What is an SLA?', 'A service-level agreement with measurable targets.'), ('Why map a process?', 'To make it repeatable and trainable.'), ('How compute accuracy?', 'Correct items divided by checked items.'), ('Capacity formula?', 'Time per task times volume gives hours.'), ('Why use sample data in training?', 'It protects real personal data.'), ('What to do on a missing input?', 'Follow the exception rule, usually return to the client.'), ('Why sample checks?', 'They find errors early at low cost.'), ('What goes in a weekly report?', 'Volume, speed, accuracy and issues.'), ('Name one security control.', 'Least access or access logging.')],
